          %h3#microscopic_brane_physics Microscopic brane physics
          %p
            The core aspect of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane"} D-brane
            physics is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/folklore"} folklore
            (see
