            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+engineering+of+quantum+field+theory"} geometric engineering of quantum field theory
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+models"} intersecting D-brane models
            and without this phenomenon, string theory would be irrelevant for
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/phenomenology"} phenomenology
          %p
            Moreover,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/folklore"} folklore
